@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : Request to create a new map
    activate System


    System --> Editor : Prompt for map name
    deactivate System


    Editor -> System : Submit **valid** map name
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Provides size list
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System: Submit **valid** size option
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Display success message: "Map created successfully."

    deactivate System
    deactivate Editor



@enduml